$$r = \frac{24 \pm \sqrt{576-128}}{4}$$

$$r = \frac{24 \pm \sqrt{448}}{4}$$

$$r = \frac{24 \pm 4\sqrt{28}}{4}$$

$$r = 6 \pm \sqrt{7}$$

Since the radius of the inscribed sphere cannot be negative, we take the positive root: $r = 6 + \sqrt{7}$.

